/Title (Every remarkable career begins with a spark. For Harsh, that spark was curiosity. Long before artificial intelligence became a global phenomenon, he found himself fascinated by understanding how technology worked beneath the surface. Growing up in India, he wasn't content simply using software or devices. He wanted to know what powered them.)
